      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí an axweesanoó alqadór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ oo Mose nguwa hara'ayín nguwa tleehhi dinkwa nee múk Israeli, qoomár tawa baraá yaamaá Moabu i dirii'i, dinkwa nee alqadoodá' AAKO MUNGÚ aa tleehhi dír tloomár Horebu wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose múk Israeli sleémeero guna dinkwárí ateét, guri báy, «Kuungá' ilaahunge aga aandé' adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa tleéhh dír waawutmoó Misri, nee geeraharuuserose, nee sagadiyuuseerose, nee yaamuuwós sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' slahh'eemisuú yaariír kudá' ugwa aandé', nee layudaá yaariire nee muruú waa/oo/amooro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala tam ay laarí AAKOÓ MUNGÚ fuqurángw muruuwí kur tsahha' nee ilaá tar xumisa', nee iaá tar axasa' nga hanisiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá har afiqoomár kureeraá mibeeraá tsiyahhe, Mungú kuungá' nuna geerahaár baraá xaanxaywo, tlabaahúng kudá' taa dahasé' naa slaxarumiti'iiká, laqaá ya/ataahúng naa harfarkini'iiká baraá ya'ahunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaáte aga /agi'iiká, laqaá difaái aga wati'iiká, laqaá gár onitamis tam ar niiná, as kawa tsahha' adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tar Munguúhúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee qoomár tawa baraá ayawií hardahaán waawutmo Sihoni oo Heshboni, nee waawutmo Ogu oo Bashani nina hardiyé', as niwa slaqwarár aya' amoorén, ala atén ina baalaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamuuín kiri hayohaán kiri qasisaán dír múk tlahhoó Reubeni, nee oo Gadi, nee tlaqtá tlahhoó Manase, as tawa aalir'ín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe ilakaaharu tleehhaak alqadoorí kawa ota', as kahhó' kuungá' diihhooa kawa sleera' baraá gadiyeduuhúng sleémeero awa taqo tlehhita'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Hám laarí kuungá' aga sihhté' dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, kuungá' sleémeero awa geeraharuusér tlahhi'i nee bariiseero, nee geeraharuuserhunge, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee na/iihunge nee tlaawayhunge, nee hoomár baraá ayaahúng hoota, tidá' migiruú feehhamiis, nee tidá' ma'ayhúng hhekiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' a diirí as lo'o kawa /aga' ar tawa data' baraá alqadór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng laarí. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós laarí kuungá' nu gawdes tawa mukós, nee inós tari Munguúhúng, adoodá' ngira lo'ór wa /aáy dír kuungá' nee baabi'iihúng, Abrahamu, nee Isaka nee Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám aníng laarí alqadoorí a tlehhitaaká as kuungá' kiloohúng, nee axweesanaywuú lo'oorí u kaahaaká as kuká' hamí naa burumburiitiye' laarí dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ala aqo as daanduú kudá' ta sangw laqwaali sleeme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuungá' a xuá' adoodá' tara hootaán baraá yaamaá Misriro, nee adoodá' tara hi'imitaán yaamaá xoordaá hatlae sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' slaqsi'ii'ín kudá' ló'wa buhhtamisá' iga aandé' awa munguaá taa tleéhh ar xaai nee tlaa/e, nee peésa nee sahaábu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimsé' ti harmagahhe' laarí hhawaata laqaá /ameeni, laqaá heé doohúng, laqaá oo tlahhayhúng tumu wák oo diirí wa sihhmiít laarí, oo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén gu sií', miwa deeruút, iri munguaá xoordaá hatlá' sagadiyér áy. Gár adór tí an adór dee/armoó aa harmaa/, mamaá qarqará' giri laqwaál, kudá' qarkú koomá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes axweesanoó alqadoorí, tí hamí lo'o kawa /agé', hee gwaa axaás, aluuwo iri sagós ar awín, nee iri ooi, ‹Aníng gár i aw i káhh, tam aníng sagagawduueé' bura eehár,› gaarí kuungá' sleémeero nu fák, múk tlákw nee oo hhoe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, heé adór kwí gu baloó gurtlayká, nee buhhtaá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nee da/itose heewí ngu al'oohiyá', lo'o sleémeero ar taa gooín baraá kitaábuuwí heedaádá' gu /ák, nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ umuú heedaádá' gun fiits gawaá daanduú yaamuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ heedaádá' gun paraatl dír tla/ángw tlahh'i sleémeero awa Israeliwo, as amotlakwe nguwa sleer ar adór lo'oodá' sleémeero ar alqado i diri', tidá' ta gooín baraá kitaábuuwuú dabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Qartadá' aluúwaá hardah, ar xwaylarhúng nee ar hoomár amór saáwá hardah baraá ayaahúng, ngi ariyá' adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ yaamuuká' ngira amotlakwérí huúw, nee slahh'amaayeero, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee adór yaamuuká' asla ngira hhitiín, nee diwto, nee adór asla ngira qororo'ós, gár ki dahamiisi káhh, gár i laqwalina' i káhh, tam gitsór ti'imiit i káhh, a adór qoomaadá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ yaamaá Sodoma nee Gomora nee Adma nee Seboimu ngira hhaamiís ar buhhtaawós kudá' xaraaslá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruuwí bur ngwa ariyé', inooín nee xoordu sleémeero tari ooi, ‹Ahaá waáy, gár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ yaamuuká' ngisa adoorí laáq? Buhhtaá adór kuká' gár i laqaqana' a milá?› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy muu iri ooi, ‹Asma inooín alqadór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngina mayé', Munguú baabi'ii'ín kudá' alqado gaa tleehh qoomár inooín ngiwa baraá yaamaá Misrír wa duúx, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inooín nina tlayé', munguaá hatlá' ngina sluufmisiyé' nee ngiri firór ayé', munguaá aáng inooín naa xui'iiká, laqaá tam AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gaa ádbayká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ buhhtaawo ina daa/atúy daanduú yaamuuká', nee lo'oodá' sleémeero taa gooín baraá kitaábuuwí, yaamuuká' giri /ák. ",
          "type": "text",
